Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:52.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Project coordinator and editor: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.14,0:02:57.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Coordinator assistants:{\c&HFFF4C5&} Martini, gaarysn
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.14,0:03:02.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Typesetter translators: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee, tommo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.77,0:01:19.11,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard you went fishing with Uk
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.15,0:01:23.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. It's boring to fish alone
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.15,0:01:25.95,general text,,0,0,0,,You once said,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.03,0:01:29.45,general text,,0,0,0,,that Chan Wook has the same fate as Master Seo Kyung
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.54,0:01:33.00,general text,,0,0,0,,So you support him and help him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.50,0:01:36.42,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm not the only one helping him
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.71,0:01:40.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Is anyone else directing him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.92,0:01:43.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.17,0:01:45.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you know this person?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.52,0:01:56.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Nobody teaches Uka to cast spells
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.65,0:01:57.65,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm sure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.23,0:02:00.94,general text,,0,0,0,,This was confirmed by his maid
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.69,0:02:05.82,general text,,0,0,0,,So, he himself reached such heights?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.90,0:02:07.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Perhaps he became the magician of Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.95,0:02:10.33,general text,,0,0,0,,thanks to tricks and luck
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.41,0:02:11.91,general text,,0,0,0,,But he has no skills
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.99,0:02:14.79,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've heard about our argument
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.17,0:02:17.50,general text,,0,0,0,,One fight left
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.21,0:02:20.25,general text,,0,0,0,,You are right
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.34,0:02:23.88,general text,,0,0,0,,The teacher would have prevented his humiliation
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.55,0:02:27.09,general text,,0,0,0,,After reading “Words of the Heart”, he received respect
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.18,0:02:29.18,general text,,0,0,0,,And our argument humiliated him
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.26,0:02:32.77,general text,,0,0,0,,He stubbornly continues to fight
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.85,0:02:34.43,general text,,0,0,0,,So this is
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.56,0:02:38.31,general text,,0,0,0,,means a lot to him
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.69,0:02:43.44,memories,,0,0,0,,Are you okay? Can you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.53,0:02:45.40,memories,,0,0,0,,Yes. And you, master?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.49,0:02:47.57,memories,,0,0,0,,You weren’t hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.20,0:02:50.28,general text,,0,0,0,,You're right
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.95,0:02:55.20,general text,,0,0,0,,I never thought about how significant jade could be for him
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.50,0:03:01.04,general text,,0,0,0,,As soon as Uk returns,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.71,0:03:03.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Bom wants to fight
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.05,0:03:05.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Is he fishing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.30,0:03:08.51,general text,,0,0,0,,And Moo Dok turns a blind eye to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.64,0:03:11.14,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s unlikely that she’s happy about this
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.22,0:03:14.72,general text,,0,0,0,,So you also noticed that Uk listens to her
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.81,0:03:18.77,general text,,0,0,0,,He is stubborn, no matter what anyone tells him
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.85,0:03:20.81,general text,,0,0,0,,But he always listens to Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.86,0:03:26.61,memories,,0,0,0,,We can protect monsters from this world
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.45,0:03:30.41,offscreen,,0,0,0,,He was talking about Nak Soo then
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.95,0:03:37.37,voiceover,,0,0,0,,If he is looking for a stone to protect her...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.92,0:03:42.38,general text,,0,0,0,,- They can’t be together\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.67,0:03:44.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.80,0:03:47.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t you like that they’re close?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.84,0:03:50.84,general text,,0,0,0,,That’s not the point
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.34,0:03:54.72,general text,,0,0,0,,If they choose the wrong path,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.93,0:03:59.39,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t help
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.36,0:04:14.45,italics,,0,0,0,,Uk can bring chaos to this world
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.58,0:04:19.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Suddenly our support will make it uncontrollable,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.54,0:04:22.00,general text,,0,0,0,,after which it will attract attention?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.08,0:04:25.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Afraid that he will encroach on the throne and bring
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.50,0:04:28.59,general text,,0,0,0,,devastation in Deho?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.09,0:04:33.34,general text,,0,0,0,,This is possible if he follows the King's star
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.93,0:04:35.89,general text,,0,0,0,,This will broaden his horizons
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.97,0:04:40.52,general text,,0,0,0,,and the desire to achieve greatness
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.27,0:04:43.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.31,0:04:46.90,general text,,0,0,0,,How long did it take you to master Chisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.73,0:04:48.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Chisu?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.19,0:04:52.32,general text,,0,0,0,,I quickly mastered Ryusu,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.40,0:04:56.58,general text,,0,0,0,,but it was more difficult to master Chisu
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.91,0:05:04.71,italics,,0,0,0,,For three years I studied to comprehend the energy of heaven
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.83,0:05:08.46,italics,,0,0,0,,It took three years to harness the energy of the earth
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.63,0:05:14.30,italics,,0,0,0,,and four years to feel the energy around
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.43,0:05:20.43,italics,,0,0,0,,The energy of heaven, earth and water that flows between them
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.31,0:05:24.31,italics,,0,0,0,,I mastered all this for ten years
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.48,0:05:28.36,italics,,0,0,0,,and comprehended Chisa
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.44,0:05:29.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Impressive
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.61,0:05:32.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Took me 13 years
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.40,0:05:34.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Yom learned everything twice as long
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.32,0:05:39.24,general text,,0,0,0,,I was second after Chang Gang
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.74,0:05:40.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Only this...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.59,0:05:52.21,general text,,0,0,0,,We see the energy that flows between heaven and earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.30,0:05:55.72,general text,,0,0,0,,but essentially it’s just water
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.10,0:06:02.56,general text,,0,0,0,,We've been trying to master this for years
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.39,0:06:06.94,general text,,0,0,0,,But there are those who can do this from birth
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.16,0:06:26.62,italics,,0,0,0,,Simply put, geniuses
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.50,0:06:29.71,italics,,0,0,0,,But the rest of the world
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.79,0:06:33.51,italics,,0,0,0,,considers them reckless, unreliable
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.59,0:06:36.22,italics,,0,0,0,,and sometimes dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.51,0:06:40.60,general text,,0,0,0,,What am I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.72,0:06:43.31,general text,,0,0,0,,mastered Chisu?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.44,0:06:49.10,italics,,0,0,0,,Because they are different from the rest
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.82,0:06:59.07,italics,,0,0,0,,Some envy them
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.91,0:07:09.33,italics,,0,0,0,,Others are afraid of them
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.00,0:07:13.42,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll definitely win tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.17,0:07:17.47,general text,,0,0,0,,I caught her
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.84,0:07:21.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.68,0:07:22.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.85,0:07:25.06,general text,,0,0,0,,You have mastered Chisa
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.31,0:07:34.90,italics,,0,0,0,,We react this way because we don’t know how they use their incredible power
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.53,0:07:39.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Will he save the world as Master So Kyung
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.61,0:07:42.99,general text,,0,0,0,,or will it destroy? We don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.20,0:07:45.62,general text,,0,0,0,,In other words,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.95,0:07:50.00,general text,,0,0,0,,continue to watch him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.83,0:07:55.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry. I understand everything
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.38,0:07:59.34,general text,,0,0,0,,If you have to get rid of this power,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.55,0:08:03.10,general text,,0,0,0,,I will do it with my own hands
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.06,0:08:11.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook, is your punishment over?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.06,0:08:13.31,general text,,0,0,0,,So I came back
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.40,0:08:14.82,general text,,0,0,0,,So you destroyed Jeonbugwan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.90,0:08:16.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t exaggerate
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.28,0:08:20.03,general text,,0,0,0,,- Hey\N- You're finally back
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.74,0:08:23.66,general text,,0,0,0,,I am your last opponent
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.32,0:08:26.66,general text,,0,0,0,,- I see\N- It’s a pity that you won’t win,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.70,0:08:31.92,general text,,0,0,0,,since I will fight with you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.38,0:08:38.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry so much
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.46,0:08:41.88,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope the last battle will be interesting
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.72,0:08:43.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Counting on you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.77,0:08:55.23,general text,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.31,0:08:57.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Did he learn anything new?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.15,0:08:59.07,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard he was just fishing
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.15,0:09:01.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, he’s just being brave
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.61,0:09:06.78,general text,,0,0,0,,I will disgrace him in front of the Crown Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.83,0:09:09.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.75,0:09:13.54,general text,,0,0,0,,My stupid master lost nine times,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.62,0:09:17.42,general text,,0,0,0,,because of which you lost nine golden toads
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.05,0:09:20.38,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t dare look you in the eye
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.76,0:09:24.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Last fight left?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.30,0:09:26.09,general text,,0,0,0,,He trained hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.18,0:09:28.51,general text,,0,0,0,,so as not to disappoint you this time
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.60,0:09:30.22,general text,,0,0,0,,So that I am not disappointed,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.81,0:09:31.89,general text,,0,0,0,,he must lose
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.48,0:09:39.07,general text,,0,0,0,,You took me for a fool
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.15,0:09:42.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Used my gold to train her master
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.74,0:09:45.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the duel
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.41,0:09:49.24,general text,,0,0,0,,you had the pleasure of watching the owner’s humiliation
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.33,0:09:51.91,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it was worth the gold
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.75,0:09:54.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was fun
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.50,0:09:56.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope he loses again,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.46,0:10:00.00,general text,,0,0,0,,so that you cry when you lose your jade
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.67,0:10:02.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook has the other half, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.67,0:10:06.13,general text,,0,0,0,,He gave you a second one,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.22,0:10:08.39,general text,,0,0,0,,so this is a symbol of love?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.76,0:10:12.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Gave it to me to use me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.65,0:10:19.31,general text,,0,0,0,,If Uk loses,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.90,0:10:20.98,general text,,0,0,0,,I will destroy jade
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.44,0:10:23.90,italics,,0,0,0,,You must lose something
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.40,0:10:25.86,general text,,0,0,0,,What a shame
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.95,0:10:28.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Your reverent love will sink into oblivion
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.54,0:10:34.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Do as you wish
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.91,0:10:37.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Jade completed its task
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.42,0:10:39.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Forced the owner to go through 10 fights
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.67,0:10:42.71,general text,,0,0,0,,You said that you would risk your life for jade
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.96,0:10:46.47,general text,,0,0,0,,If we can risk our lives for our feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.88,0:10:51.22,general text,,0,0,0,,the loss of this stone will not affect them
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.40,0:11:00.98,general text,,0,0,0,,So you don’t care whether you lose him or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.19,0:11:03.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.28,0:11:05.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Then I'll throw it away
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.16,0:11:17.75,general text,,0,0,0,,So it really doesn’t mean anything
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.79,0:11:20.88,general text,,0,0,0,,You deceived me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.96,0:11:23.25,general text,,0,0,0,,She said that this is the most valuable thing
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.34,0:11:26.17,general text,,0,0,0,,And if you don’t worry about her, then you lied
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.38,0:11:29.59,general text,,0,0,0,,How will you pay for a lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.68,0:11:31.43,general text,,0,0,0,,You're risking your life, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.10,0:11:33.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Excellent
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:36.73,general text,,0,0,0,,You’re at stake this time
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.60,0:11:40.69,general text,,0,0,0,,I have already lost nine toads
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.31,0:11:42.77,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to lose another one
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.86,0:11:44.61,general text,,0,0,0,,You will be a reward
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.90,0:11:47.19,general text,,0,0,0,,in this fight
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.57,0:11:51.20,general text,,0,0,0,,As you order
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.28,0:11:52.45,general text,,0,0,0,,If Chang Wook loses,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.41,0:11:56.37,general text,,0,0,0,,you will become the maid of the winner
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.62,0:12:00.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'll think about it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.77,0:12:19.60,general text,,0,0,0,,So you are Chan Wook’s last opponent?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.98,0:12:22.60,general text,,0,0,0,,I am Cha Bum
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.69,0:12:24.40,general text,,0,0,0,,I will win no matter what
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.44,0:12:27.19,general text,,0,0,0,,You must
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.28,0:12:28.82,general text,,0,0,0,,If you lose,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.90,0:12:31.57,general text,,0,0,0,,I will make sure that you will not succeed as a magician
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.41,0:12:35.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Can you give the floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.58,0:12:39.62,general text,,0,0,0,,There is always a probability...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.70,0:12:40.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.96,0:12:44.25,general text,,0,0,0,,I need someone who will definitely win
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.33,0:12:45.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Give me your word
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.79,0:12:48.34,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I can't, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.42,0:12:50.09,general text,,0,0,0,,No one but him...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.93,0:12:53.47,general text,,0,0,0,,will not give this word
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.10,0:12:58.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Only one person left,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.60,0:13:01.18,general text,,0,0,0,,who can win
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.27,0:13:02.27,general text,,0,0,0,,So Yul
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.23,0:13:09.48,general text,,0,0,0,,So Yul?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.12,0:13:24.25,general text,,0,0,0,,The dispute was nothing serious
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.08,0:13:27.09,general text,,0,0,0,,But he annoys me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.17,0:13:31.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I lost nine toads to put Uka in his place
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.26,0:13:35.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Imagine how funny I will look,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.72,0:13:39.60,general text,,0,0,0,,if he wins the last fight
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.14,0:13:43.73,general text,,0,0,0,,So I need someone who will definitely win
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.81,0:13:46.48,general text,,0,0,0,,You are the best magician of Jeongjingak and my cousin
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.56,0:13:48.02,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're the only one
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.69,0:13:52.99,general text,,0,0,0,,I know you are friends with him
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.74,0:13:58.16,general text,,0,0,0,,But as a prince and your cousin,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.91,0:14:00.49,general text,,0,0,0,,I ask for your help
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.33,0:14:05.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.92,0:14:08.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.92,0:14:11.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Will you fight him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.46,0:14:13.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I will win
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.38,0:14:15.84,general text,,0,0,0,,I give my word
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.01,0:14:20.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly. Out of everyone, only you can
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.56,0:14:22.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok really promised to serve
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.02,0:14:24.85,general text,,0,0,0,,winner?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.93,0:14:27.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, instead of toads she put
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.61,0:14:34.65,general text,,0,0,0,,on yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.74,0:14:36.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Then I will defeat Uka
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.07,0:14:39.82,general text,,0,0,0,,and I will make her my maid
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.37,0:14:45.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.12,0:14:48.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Chang Wook's last opponent, come forward
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.82,0:15:17.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Chang Wook,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.91,0:15:20.78,general text,,0,0,0,,fight with you today
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.49,0:15:22.74,general text,,0,0,0,,I will be
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.01,0:15:45.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Is So Yul fighting with him to let him win?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.10,0:15:46.10,italics,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.18,0:15:49.27,italics,,0,0,0,,When Dan Gu volunteered, Chang Wook gave in immediately
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.35,0:15:50.77,italics,,0,0,0,,He won't let Uku win
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.85,0:15:54.40,general text,,0,0,0,,He gave the prince his word that he would defeat Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.65,0:15:59.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Begin
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.92,0:16:16.21,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Yul was right
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.92,0:16:19.09,general text,,0,0,0,,UK has improved greatly
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.11,0:16:35.52,general text,,0,0,0,,This is my protective spell
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.61,0:16:36.73,general text,,0,0,0,,When did he master it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.57,0:16:41.32,italics,,0,0,0,,He learned everything he saw in previous fights
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.40,0:16:45.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Has he mastered the spells of previous opponents?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.41,0:16:49.16,general text,,0,0,0,,He learned the spells he saw and repeats them
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.22,0:17:50.35,general text,,0,0,0,,He did it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.34,0:18:27.84,general text,,0,0,0,,The fight is over
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.93,0:18:30.43,general text,,0,0,0,,So Yul won
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.56,0:18:35.69,general text,,0,0,0,,I knew it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.10,0:18:39.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk lost all ten fights
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.69,0:18:43.65,general text,,0,0,0,,How did he use Tansa at the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.74,0:18:46.78,italics,,0,0,0,,He collected the energy in the air and turned it into water
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.86,0:18:47.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t be funny
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.70,0:18:51.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Only those who own Chisu can do this
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.84,0:19:05.21,general text,,0,0,0,,When did you master Chisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.80,0:19:09.51,general text,,0,0,0,,I said yesterday that I would tell you something amazing
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.59,0:19:11.05,general text,,0,0,0,,That was great
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.85,0:19:13.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Congratulations
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.31,0:19:14.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.18,0:19:17.64,general text,,0,0,0,,You have mastered Chisu. Congratulations, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.65,0:19:19.60,italics,,0,0,0,,Did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.23,0:19:22.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Our Chan Wook has mastered Chisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.28,0:19:26.03,general text,,0,0,0,,- Really?\N- Hey
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.11,0:19:28.07,general text,,0,0,0,,- Congratulations\N- Congratulations
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.15,0:19:30.62,italics,,0,0,0,,- Amazing\N- Congratulations
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.70,0:19:31.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.95,0:19:34.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Time to Saejukwon
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.75,0:19:46.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok left with the prince
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.80,0:19:49.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Probably discussing the end of the dispute
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.55,0:19:52.22,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm just worried that they'll do something like that again
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.30,0:19:53.97,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll check
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.06,0:19:57.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. Take care of her. You are her owner now
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.69,0:20:04.11,general text,,0,0,0,,So we want the prince to think
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.15,0:20:08.78,general text,,0,0,0,,So Yul, go to Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.86,0:20:10.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk, and you are with me in Saejukwon
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.32,0:20:13.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go. Hurry
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.58,0:20:16.54,italics,,0,0,0,,- Be careful. Well!\N- It hurts
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.62,0:20:18.12,italics,,0,0,0,,Look under your feet
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.25,0:20:27.42,general text,,0,0,0,,As you said, the owner lost all ten times
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.05,0:20:29.84,general text,,0,0,0,,You win, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.72,0:20:34.39,general text,,0,0,0,,You knew that he mastered Chisu
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.97,0:20:38.77,general text,,0,0,0,,So I boldly put myself on the line
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.85,0:20:41.06,general text,,0,0,0,,If Cha Bum had not refused the fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.73,0:20:43.40,general text,,0,0,0,,the owner would win
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.81,0:20:46.48,general text,,0,0,0,,He is no longer your master
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.36,0:20:50.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Now you serve Seo Yul
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.24,0:20:56.03,general text,,0,0,0,,You said that you share the same feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.37,0:20:58.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Excellent
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.29,0:21:01.96,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope you don’t lose them while you serve another
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.40,0:21:25.77,italics,,0,0,0,,This is funny
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.86,0:21:28.15,general text,,0,0,0,,How could he master Chisa so quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.23,0:21:30.86,general text,,0,0,0,,It's true. We've seen it all
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.49,0:21:32.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.56,0:22:02.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Holy heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.56,0:22:05.77,general text,,0,0,0,,You really are a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.85,0:22:07.40,general text,,0,0,0,,That’s right, Uk!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.48,0:22:09.65,general text,,0,0,0,,- It hurt\N- Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.69,0:22:12.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Huo, it hurts me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.94,0:22:15.20,general text,,0,0,0,,You joined because you were worried,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.28,0:22:17.41,general text,,0,0,0,,that I will have to serve Cha Bum, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.49,0:22:19.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your kindness
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.91,0:22:21.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Now you serve me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.75,0:22:25.37,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the promise I made to the prince
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.04,0:22:27.67,general text,,0,0,0,,And I have to pretend to follow it
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.75,0:22:28.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.92,0:22:32.42,general text,,0,0,0,,If you need anything, speak at any time
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.51,0:22:33.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Nothing needed
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.22,0:22:36.34,general text,,0,0,0,,You can visit Uka at any time
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.22,0:22:39.39,general text,,0,0,0,,I have
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.97,0:22:42.60,general text,,0,0,0,,just one request
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.27,0:22:47.60,general text,,0,0,0,,When I finish my studies, I will return to Soho
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.56,0:22:50.61,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to take one person with me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.52,0:22:53.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Please help me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.90,0:22:55.95,general text,,0,0,0,,do it
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.78,0:23:00.24,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t know you had such a person
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.32,0:23:03.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Give your word. Promise you'll help
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.87,0:23:10.42,general text,,0,0,0,,You ask being my master
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.00,0:23:13.05,general text,,0,0,0,,I will definitely help you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.14,0:23:27.31,general text,,0,0,0,,There is now a soul swallower in Saejukwon
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.39,0:23:29.15,general text,,0,0,0,,And you brought Uka here
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.23,0:23:31.56,general text,,0,0,0,,What could I do? He's wounded
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.15,0:23:35.32,general text,,0,0,0,,I told him to rest for a couple of days
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.61,0:23:38.65,general text,,0,0,0,,- Is he seriously injured?\N- No
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.74,0:23:40.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Nothing serious
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.49,0:23:44.91,general text,,0,0,0,,How could he fight Yul so recklessly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.99,0:23:47.54,general text,,0,0,0,,I would continue fishing with Master Li
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.62,0:23:49.29,general text,,0,0,0,,You shouldn’t have called him back
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.21,0:23:53.88,general text,,0,0,0,,They must have done more than just fish
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.84,0:23:59.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk, such a bastard, mastered Chisu
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.88,0:24:00.89,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.30,0:24:03.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Incredible, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.85,0:24:05.26,italics,,0,0,0,,Incomprehensible
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.35,0:24:07.22,general text,,0,0,0,,He really is a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.11,0:24:17.53,general text,,0,0,0,,What did you study
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.36,0:24:22.24,general text,,0,0,0,,while fishing
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.32,0:24:23.95,general text,,0,0,0,,with Master Li?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.62,0:24:27.50,general text,,0,0,0,,I learned to catch Goldfish
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.58,0:24:30.92,general text,,0,0,0,,So he wanted to help you master Chisa
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.50,0:24:34.59,general text,,0,0,0,,- Did he take you as a student?{\i1}\N- Not really
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.67,0:24:36.63,general text,,0,0,0,,There's a reason he's helping me
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.59,0:24:39.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.18,0:24:43.97,italics,,0,0,0,,Master to you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.72,0:24:45.89,general text,,0,0,0,,something...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.43,0:24:48.72,general text,,0,0,0,,told?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.64,0:24:52.48,general text,,0,0,0,,This concerns my family
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.56,0:24:54.98,general text,,0,0,0,,I noticed this myself and asked him directly
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.28,0:25:02.45,general text,,0,0,0,,It seems you know this too
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.99,0:25:06.20,general text,,0,0,0,,I was hoping
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.24,0:25:09.79,general text,,0,0,0,,that you won’t recognize
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.71,0:25:11.96,italics,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.04,0:25:15.25,general text,,0,0,0,,I couldn’t close my eyes to this when I found out everything
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.67,0:25:18.17,italics,,0,0,0,,What will you do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.72,0:25:23.97,general text,,0,0,0,,With maid Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.48,0:25:33.81,general text,,0,0,0,,What does she have to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.89,0:25:36.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Lee is trying to woo the maid Kim,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.65,0:25:38.61,general text,,0,0,0,,helping me
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.94,0:25:41.49,general text,,0,0,0,,So what will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.70,0:25:47.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li is a wonderful person who helped me a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.87,0:25:49.70,italics,,0,0,0,,But still
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.70,0:25:54.12,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought I should give you a chance first
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.21,0:25:55.79,general text,,0,0,0,,If we take our relationship into account
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.55,0:26:01.01,general text,,0,0,0,,What chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.13,0:26:05.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you know that Master Li lives with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.34,0:26:08.93,general text,,0,0,0,,And I was wondering where he stopped
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.01,0:26:11.22,general text,,0,0,0,,So he lived in your house
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.31,0:26:12.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.39,0:26:15.56,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m here now, and they’re probably drinking tea there, talking
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.64,0:26:17.73,general text,,0,0,0,,The maid Kim is very kind
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.81,0:26:20.32,general text,,0,0,0,,She loves to care for and feed others
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.40,0:26:22.82,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s a matter of time before she falls in love with him
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.90,0:26:26.61,general text,,0,0,0,,I really hope
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.70,0:26:29.53,general text,,0,0,0,,that she will marry a good man
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.91,0:26:34.54,general text,,0,0,0,,If you don’t mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.37,0:26:38.21,general text,,0,0,0,,I would like to support them
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.85,0:26:54.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li is twice her age
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.31,0:26:58.56,general text,,0,0,0,,But he looks younger than you
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.65,0:27:00.19,italics,,0,0,0,,This is nonsense anyway
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.27,0:27:03.48,general text,,0,0,0,,He practices chastity
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.36,0:27:06.11,general text,,0,0,0,,How can they get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.70,0:27:10.24,general text,,0,0,0,,I suppressed my instincts for the sake of training, but then quickly recovered
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.32,0:27:11.87,general text,,0,0,0,,It's possible
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.95,0:27:13.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Marriage must be by mutual consent
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.25,0:27:17.21,general text,,0,0,0,,She must want it too
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.29,0:27:18.96,general text,,0,0,0,,She all these years
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.96,0:27:23.75,general text,,0,0,0,,loves one person
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.21,0:27:26.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.47,0:27:32.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you really think that she still loves Chang Gang?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.35,0:27:36.73,general text,,0,0,0,,I know her better than anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.31,0:27:40.27,general text,,0,0,0,,So I ask you, do not make hasty conclusions
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.31,0:27:44.73,general text,,0,0,0,,What should I do with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.82,0:27:46.86,general text,,0,0,0,,And he calls someone else stupid,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.94,0:27:49.41,general text,,0,0,0,,when he doesn’t see anything under his nose
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.49,0:27:50.87,general text,,0,0,0,,What do you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.45,0:27:54.29,general text,,0,0,0,,She stopped loving Chang Gan a long time ago
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.98,0:28:20.23,general text,,0,0,0,,On that day
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.85,0:28:23.15,general text,,0,0,0,,he was here too
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.99,0:28:30.07,general text,,0,0,0,,This is freshly brewed quince tea
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.15,0:28:31.24,general text,,0,0,0,,What a pleasant aroma
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.87,0:28:35.74,general text,,0,0,0,,It is not good to keep withered flowers in the house
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.83,0:28:38.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Cold weather has arrived, flowers are hard to find now
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.79,0:28:40.71,general text,,0,0,0,,But I’ll listen to you and throw them away
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.04,0:28:43.71,general text,,0,0,0,,I liked the way the flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.79,0:28:45.67,general text,,0,0,0,,kept me company
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.98,0:29:03.02,general text,,0,0,0,,I completely forgot about the cups and only brought a teapot
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.61,0:29:11.61,general text,,0,0,0,,How could they bloom again?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.78,0:29:14.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.53,0:29:17.37,general text,,0,0,0,,What a beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.76,0:29:36.01,general text,,0,0,0,,It must be,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.97,0:29:39.22,general text,,0,0,0,,he gave her flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.85,0:29:42.43,general text,,0,0,0,,that day
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.07,0:29:53.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li, you are very kind and sympathetic
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.45,0:29:55.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.28,0:29:58.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Stay here as long as you want
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.87,0:30:00.62,general text,,0,0,0,,I will take care of you
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.33,0:30:03.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.63,0:30:09.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Is this girl Chang Gan's wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.46,0:30:14.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, beautiful, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.72,0:30:18.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Is it Jin who was head over heels in love with her? Yeom told
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.97,0:30:27.02,general text,,0,0,0,,She did not wither and kept her beauty intact
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.81,0:30:31.53,italics,,0,0,0,,Maybe that’s why he still can’t forget her
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.94,0:30:34.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Or
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.11,0:30:36.66,general text,,0,0,0,,he just doesn’t like me
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.49,0:30:38.70,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.83,0:30:46.92,general text,,0,0,0,,I understand, that’s what the prince ordered
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.00,0:30:49.25,general text,,0,0,0,,But how could he forbid Moo Deok from visiting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.34,0:30:51.17,general text,,0,0,0,,She was worried all the time
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.25,0:30:53.84,italics,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she's just busy
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.92,0:30:55.72,general text,,0,0,0,,I told her that you're fine
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.80,0:30:56.72,italics,,0,0,0,,Well, no
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.80,0:30:59.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think she immediately relaxed after your words?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.85,0:31:00.93,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to check
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.10,0:31:03.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Come here
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.06,0:31:07.98,general text,,0,0,0,,This will only cause you pain
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.69,0:31:13.98,general text,,0,0,0,,This bird delivers my letters to Soho
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.95,0:31:20.91,general text,,0,0,0,,It takes three to four days to get there by horse
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.99,0:31:22.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Can a bird fly this distance?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.24,0:31:24.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Incredible
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.34,0:31:38.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you have a whistle?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.05,0:31:42.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I don’t carry it with me
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.89,0:31:48.35,general text,,0,0,0,,This is a gift from your loved one
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.44,0:31:49.27,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm hurt
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.91,0:32:02.83,general text,,0,0,0,,You need to blow twice for the bird to return
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.12,0:32:05.54,general text,,0,0,0,,You did well
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.12,0:32:07.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Try
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.03,0:32:38.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Look
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.32,0:32:42.82,general text,,0,0,0,,The bird is back
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.16,0:32:46.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Now blow twice quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.64,0:33:12.44,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I said that to calm him down
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.52,0:33:15.23,memories,,0,0,0,,He was worried that his tame bird had a hard time in the winter,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.15,0:33:17.77,memories,,0,0,0,,so I lied
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.32,0:33:23.03,general text,,0,0,0,,See? Moo Deok is doing well
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.03,0:33:29.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, Uk
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.16,0:33:32.37,general text,,0,0,0,,What exactly did Moo Dok argue with the Crown Prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.46,0:33:33.83,general text,,0,0,0,,The thing you wanted back
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.79,0:33:39.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Doesn’t matter. Now I can't get her back since I lost
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.68,0:33:49.64,general text,,0,0,0,,But why was she so carefree when she lost him?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.94,0:34:00.15,italics,,0,0,0,,- So what was that?\N- Don’t ask
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.73,0:34:04.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Why have you never visited Wook in Saejukwon?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.78,0:34:08.53,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m your new master, but you don’t have to worry about it
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.37,0:34:11.16,general text,,0,0,0,,That’s not the point
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.66,0:34:13.66,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm just trying not to be shameless
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.34,0:34:27.72,memories italics,,0,0,0,,So you don’t care whether you lose him or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.31,0:34:34.81,offscreen,,0,0,0,,I have to find him. I must find him today
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.10,0:34:38.94,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Only then will I be able to look into his eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.95,0:34:52.29,italics,,0,0,0,,I knew it
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.50,0:34:57.00,general text,,0,0,0,,He drinks that tea
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.96,0:35:00.92,general text,,0,0,0,,He disgraced the magicians and ran away
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.00,0:35:04.80,general text,,0,0,0,,And then he improved and defeated the Crown Prince. This is weird
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.88,0:35:07.26,general text,,0,0,0,,He decided to become Master Li's student
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.34,0:35:09.09,general text,,0,0,0,,and practice chastity
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.18,0:35:10.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you all seen Master Li?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.18,0:35:12.60,general text,,0,0,0,,He was a student of master So Kyung,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.68,0:35:14.47,italics,,0,0,0,,and Master Ho Yeom is his student
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.56,0:35:16.69,general text,,0,0,0,,But he looks younger than our head
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.77,0:35:19.19,general text,,0,0,0,,And all because he practices chastity
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.27,0:35:23.11,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard that he does not age because he reached the highest level in his youth
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.19,0:35:26.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Is that so? I heard he became younger thanks to a spell
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.32,0:35:27.20,italics,,0,0,0,,Spell?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.28,0:35:30.20,general text,,0,0,0,,That’s not important. Uk is determined
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.28,0:35:31.74,general text,,0,0,0,,And what if he reached Chisu?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.33,0:35:33.66,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm in his place
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.79,0:35:37.54,general text,,0,0,0,,wouldn’t refrain
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.25,0:35:39.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course, me too
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.92,0:35:41.75,general text,,0,0,0,,- He really is stubborn\N- And don’t tell
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.30,0:35:46.67,general text,,0,0,0,,They're just all jealous
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.47,0:35:51.80,general text,,0,0,0,,There are so many terrible rumors about Mr. Chang Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.69,0:36:00.94,general text,,0,0,0,,I was able
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.73,0:36:05.15,general text,,0,0,0,,get some sleep thanks to her meds
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.82,0:36:10.95,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that medicinal herbs were beneficial
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.99,0:36:15.49,general text,,0,0,0,,I used valerian root, which grows in the swamps of the Vol fortress
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.58,0:36:17.37,general text,,0,0,0,,He is known for being soothing
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.45,0:36:21.25,general text,,0,0,0,,It should help you relax and improve your sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.79,0:36:24.25,general text,,0,0,0,,I understand why Master Ho Yeom recommended you
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.71,0:36:28.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, I can now get some sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.26,0:36:31.55,general text,,0,0,0,,But the tinnitus and headache still remain
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.64,0:36:34.01,general text,,0,0,0,,The news about the nomads has worsened
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.10,0:36:35.89,general text,,0,0,0,,your state
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.97,0:36:38.52,general text,,0,0,0,,A nomad tried to enter the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.60,0:36:41.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Inside, perhaps they are there too
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.02,0:36:43.44,italics,,0,0,0,,Gwangju Deputy Jin Moo
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.52,0:36:45.52,general text,,0,0,0,,heightened security, so don’t worry
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.61,0:36:48.24,general text,,0,0,0,,It was his man who tried to get here!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.99,0:36:50.11,italics,,0,0,0,,And there are rumors,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.20,0:36:53.16,general text,,0,0,0,,that another nomad was seen in Chonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.99,0:36:56.74,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t trust anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.62,0:37:03.00,general text,,0,0,0,,It seems that your anxiety comes from the heart, Your Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.08,0:37:06.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can look for another way to calm you down?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.67,0:37:11.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you know Hemp Master Li?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.22,0:37:13.26,general text,,0,0,0,,The last student of master So Kyung
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.84,0:37:15.93,italics,,0,0,0,,I heard about him,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.01,0:37:17.97,general text,,0,0,0,,but saw only once in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.77,0:37:22.98,general text,,0,0,0,,My grandfather was his student, so I heard a lot about him
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.06,0:37:27.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe it can ease your anxiety
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.98,0:37:29.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that he can determine,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.90,0:37:31.99,general text,,0,0,0,,are there any nomads around me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.07,0:37:34.61,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know him personally, so I don’t know
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.70,0:37:38.33,general text,,0,0,0,,I think you can invite him to the palace and ask for help
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.75,0:37:46.59,general text,,0,0,0,,I told you to clean here every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.67,0:37:49.21,general text,,0,0,0,,The water in the vase has spoiled!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.51,0:37:51.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.38,0:37:54.01,italics,,0,0,0,,What if Boo Young came back
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.09,0:37:56.14,general text,,0,0,0,,and saw a vase with stagnant water here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.22,0:37:57.89,general text,,0,0,0,,She would be disappointed in me
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.93,0:38:00.56,italics,,0,0,0,,Change the sheets
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.64,0:38:02.02,general text,,0,0,0,,and get rid of it
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.10,0:38:04.06,general text,,0,0,0,,She's blind, so why did you put this here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.14,0:38:05.81,italics,,0,0,0,,For her to trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.70,0:38:20.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Dozens of girls have already come to us,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.12,0:38:23.62,general text,,0,0,0,,but Bu Young was not among them
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.16,0:38:28.38,general text,,0,0,0,,She is upset about this, has become very sensitive
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.46,0:38:29.80,general text,,0,0,0,,I noticed that too
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.71,0:38:33.55,general text,,0,0,0,,But your birthday is coming soon
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.55,0:38:39.55,general text,,0,0,0,,- Here\N- What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.56,0:38:45.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Dad, they are so beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.69,0:38:48.77,general text,,0,0,0,,But my birthday is not today
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.86,0:38:51.48,general text,,0,0,0,,On this day I will give something more beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.07,0:38:55.45,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to try them on. Can you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.95,0:38:58.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.37,0:39:06.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's see how beautiful my daughter is
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.92,0:39:10.63,general text,,0,0,0,,When I was little, you always braided my hair
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.26,0:39:19.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Mother never did this
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.51,0:39:23.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry. Is it very painful?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.52,0:39:25.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Everything is fine
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.16,0:39:43.74,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ve probably forgotten how to braid my hair, I haven’t done it for a long time
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.83,0:39:44.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.91,0:39:48.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Everything is fine. What do I look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.62,0:39:50.25,general text,,0,0,0,,You are always beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.78,0:40:25.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Pak Jin shot me with this bow
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.58,0:40:30.08,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I lost that day
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.17,0:40:33.54,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I can’t come up with excuses or not accept the outcome of the battle
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.09,0:40:38.05,voiceover,,0,0,0,,But when I get my power back,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.01,0:40:42.01,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I would like to fight him for real
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.98,0:40:55.07,italics,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.65,0:40:58.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Getting out, chapter
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.57,0:41:02.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t touch everything
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.70,0:41:05.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Weapons containing the energy of a strong magician,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.95,0:41:08.75,general text,,0,0,0,,dangerous for a fragile girl
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.37,0:41:12.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Even I know this
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.17,0:41:16.38,general text,,0,0,0,,But why did you put it here?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.46,0:41:19.05,general text,,0,0,0,,I should clean up here
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.13,0:41:21.88,general text,,0,0,0,,I usually hang it on the wall
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.97,0:41:24.14,general text,,0,0,0,,I forgot this time
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.22,0:41:25.93,general text,,0,0,0,,But you are still so young
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.01,0:41:29.60,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t believe you’re already so forgetful
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.31,0:41:33.56,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m just worried, like a servant of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.65,0:41:36.65,general text,,0,0,0,,What if you forget to pay me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.44,0:41:38.53,italics,,0,0,0,,Chapter
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.61,0:41:42.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Please, be healthy. You are still so young
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.41,0:41:48.41,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll be back later to finish cleaning up
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.42,0:41:56.58,general text,,0,0,0,,How smart,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.38,0:41:59.00,general text,,0,0,0,,but an impudent girl
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.71,0:42:01.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Like Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.34,0:42:04.34,general text,,0,0,0,,met with Uk?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.43,0:42:05.93,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know the details
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.01,0:42:09.85,general text,,0,0,0,,But I heard that he paid her debts and took her from Chwisongru
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.93,0:42:12.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Then go to Chwisongru
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.14,0:42:14.77,general text,,0,0,0,,and ask about her
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.48,0:42:19.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Learn about her past and her character
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.11,0:42:21.94,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm just curious
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.49,0:42:27.37,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know much either
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.45,0:42:30.49,general text,,0,0,0,,But the merchant who brought her is now in the capital
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.58,0:42:33.20,general text,,0,0,0,,I will tell him to come to Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.83,0:42:38.04,italics,,0,0,0,,Hey there
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.50,0:42:42.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Have we already met in the village of Sari?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.80,0:42:44.51,general text,,0,0,0,,What do you need this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.59,0:42:45.76,general text,,0,0,0,,So I
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.84,0:42:47.80,italics,,0,0,0,,Have you met her in the capital?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.30,0:42:50.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you know where she could be?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.68,0:42:53.77,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know. She is not a resident of Sari
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.35,0:42:57.60,general text,,0,0,0,,She was there for a couple of months, and then she robbed the villagers
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.69,0:42:59.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Let me know if you catch her
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.07,0:43:06.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Where can I find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.41,0:43:11.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Here you go
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.20,0:43:14.58,general text,,0,0,0,,So Yi, you've made some bad friends
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.08,0:43:19.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe she went to look for Moo Deok?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.63,0:43:25.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Soon I will take you to Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.30,0:43:27.88,general text,,0,0,0,,But first we need to take care of something
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.81,0:43:40.27,memories,,0,0,0,,Here, eat
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.36,0:43:42.52,memories,,0,0,0,,You stole my money
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.61,0:43:43.86,memories,,0,0,0,,Give back my ring
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.57,0:43:52.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you meet them in the capital?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.45,0:43:55.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, but why did you bring them here?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.58,0:43:58.37,general text,,0,0,0,,I like that you are smart and persistent
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.92,0:44:00.83,general text,,0,0,0,,But that also makes you dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.92,0:44:03.92,general text,,0,0,0,,I want you to see something
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.73,0:44:21.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Gwangju Deputy
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.48,0:44:25.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you for feeding me
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.00,0:45:28.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Be afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.55,0:45:32.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Betray me or reveal your identity, and you will suffer the same fate
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.39,0:45:39.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.35,0:45:42.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Tell me if there is anyone else who might recognize you
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.48,0:45:44.81,italics,,0,0,0,,I have to get rid of them
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.31,0:45:47.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.65,0:45:52.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.20,0:45:59.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Search more carefully. I definitely threw it there
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.87,0:46:01.25,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t see anything
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.83,0:46:04.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Look there
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.21,0:46:06.96,general text,,0,0,0,,I took a good look, there’s nothing there
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.04,0:46:08.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Look again
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.84,0:46:10.21,general text,,0,0,0,,I can barely see...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.38,0:46:12.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.13,0:46:15.09,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's here somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.18,0:46:16.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, look there
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.43,0:46:22.77,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.98,0:46:26.27,general text,,0,0,0,,None of your business. Go away
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.44,0:46:30.98,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid eunuch O is suffering in vain
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.07,0:46:34.65,general text,,0,0,0,,I have to say something. Can?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.74,0:46:36.28,general text,,0,0,0,,What do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.70,0:46:38.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.70,0:46:40.79,general text,,0,0,0,,you are looking for
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.58,0:46:43.12,general text,,0,0,0,,is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.71,0:46:45.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you found it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.79,0:46:49.21,general text,,0,0,0,,I searched day and night, found it not so long ago
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.84,0:46:55.26,general text,,0,0,0,,You threw it away
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.93,0:46:58.51,general text,,0,0,0,,And I picked it up, which means it’s mine again
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.89,0:47:05.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Eunuch Oh, you can get out of there
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.60,0:47:07.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.07,0:47:14.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, I gained something valuable
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.90,0:47:18.07,general text,,0,0,0,,I have it again thanks to you
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.66,0:47:20.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.78,0:47:24.75,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t break it, didn’t throw it far
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.83,0:47:27.33,general text,,0,0,0,,You found it because I threw it close
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.42,0:47:32.92,general text,,0,0,0,,I dare to try to understand you, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.00,0:47:36.13,general text,,0,0,0,,You make excuses and are angry because
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.22,0:47:38.26,general text,,0,0,0,,what are you sorry for?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.89,0:47:41.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Von Moo Deok should only listen without trying to understand
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.93,0:47:43.72,general text,,0,0,0,,How dare you even try?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.81,0:47:45.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.06,0:47:50.15,italics,,0,0,0,,Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.94,0:47:55.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.15,0:47:58.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Ho asked me to tell you that Master Li has arrived
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.91,0:48:01.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay. Is he in Saejukwon?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.16,0:48:04.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. His student Chang Wook is with him
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.41,0:48:08.83,general text,,0,0,0,,They say Chan Wook has achieved such success
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.92,0:48:10.83,general text,,0,0,0,,thanks to the instructions of Master Li
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.92,0:48:12.67,general text,,0,0,0,,If not for this,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.75,0:48:14.88,general text,,0,0,0,,he would not defeat you
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.88,0:48:18.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.94,0:48:33.44,general text,,0,0,0,,You now serve Seo Yul, not Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.07,0:48:36.48,general text,,0,0,0,,If I had defeated Chang Wook,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.57,0:48:38.28,general text,,0,0,0,,would you serve me
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.36,0:48:40.15,general text,,0,0,0,,If you had not refused the fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.86,0:48:43.87,general text,,0,0,0,,you wouldn’t have to serve me
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.95,0:48:46.66,general text,,0,0,0,,I would let him win out of pity
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.25,0:48:48.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t you feel sorry for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.75,0:48:50.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Everyone in Sosnovy Bor knows,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.50,0:48:52.75,general text,,0,0,0,,that Chan Wook practices chastity
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.33,0:48:55.17,general text,,0,0,0,,- Is that so?\N- Don’t pretend you don’t know
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.25,0:48:56.55,general text,,0,0,0,,You know better than anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.13,0:48:59.17,general text,,0,0,0,,You didn’t bring it to him
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.76,0:49:01.18,general text,,0,0,0,,chastity tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.26,0:49:02.43,general text,,0,0,0,,I've never done this
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.51,0:49:05.60,general text,,0,0,0,,How else did he master Chisa so quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.97,0:49:08.98,general text,,0,0,0,,He's not even Chang Gan's son
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.31,0:49:14.02,general text,,0,0,0,,His mother married Chang Gan and gave birth to a son
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.73,0:49:17.36,general text,,0,0,0,,And now her son will inherit everything
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.69,0:49:22.49,general text,,0,0,0,,His father closed his gate to end the line of Uka
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.57,0:49:25.53,general text,,0,0,0,,But Chan Wook opened them, he should be chaste
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.45,0:49:27.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.83,0:49:32.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Sneaky and nasty
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.62,0:49:33.46,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.00,0:49:36.25,general text,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.50,0:49:40.17,general text,,0,0,0,,- You heard\N- How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.67,0:49:43.22,general text,,0,0,0,,- Repeat\N- Then you will hit me
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.30,0:49:44.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Then tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.93,0:49:48.18,italics,,0,0,0,,Tell them
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.48,0:49:59.69,general text,,0,0,0,,If they should hear,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.78,0:50:03.57,general text,,0,0,0,,say it loud and clear
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.37,0:50:12.46,general text,,0,0,0,,You are vile and nasty
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.50,0:50:17.04,general text,,0,0,0,,That's what she said. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.67,0:50:18.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.59,0:50:22.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, I gave you something
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.42,0:50:23.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Show them
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.47,0:50:32.23,general text,,0,0,0,,This sachet is my gift
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.31,0:50:36.44,general text,,0,0,0,,If someone beats, scolds or insults you when I’m not around,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.52,0:50:38.31,general text,,0,0,0,,just tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.57,0:50:40.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.61,0:50:43.86,general text,,0,0,0,,You can go
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.08,0:50:55.62,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s stupid to make an enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.71,0:50:59.29,general text,,0,0,0,,out of envy that someone is stronger
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.72,0:51:10.39,general text,,0,0,0,,You have ink on your clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.06,0:51:13.77,general text,,0,0,0,,They can be bred with white rice
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.02,0:51:17.10,general text,,0,0,0,,These are two completely different colors
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.94,0:51:20.56,general text,,0,0,0,,But together they can remove the stain
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.19,0:51:22.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Words of wisdom
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.44,0:51:25.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Where did you read them, Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.32,0:51:28.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Here and there
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.82,0:51:31.08,general text,,0,0,0,,This is asked only in the most difficult exams
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.55,0:51:47.43,general text,,0,0,0,,My master is not here?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.85,0:51:53.72,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard you were wounded. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.31,0:51:57.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, thanks to you. Thanks for those medicines
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.27,0:52:03.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Maid Kim invited me to dinner
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.69,0:52:07.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you will join us?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.74,0:52:09.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.78,0:52:14.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Then I will choose a day and tell Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.58,0:52:17.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you know my maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.16,0:52:20.21,general text,,0,0,0,,I once came to see you,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.29,0:52:21.92,general text,,0,0,0,,but it didn’t work out for me
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.71,0:52:25.25,general text,,0,0,0,,She came into your room then
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.97,0:52:32.14,memories,,0,0,0,,Don’t go
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.35,0:52:35.14,memories,,0,0,0,,Don’t go to your place, stay here
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.10,0:52:37.89,memories,,0,0,0,,I'll bring your clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.98,0:52:41.02,general text,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.90,0:52:43.23,general text,,0,0,0,,A step towards?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.77,0:52:45.32,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.23,0:52:48.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes so
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.49,0:52:56.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Just a second
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.75,0:52:59.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Calm
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.75,0:53:01.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Flew away
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.71,0:53:04.09,general text,,0,0,0,,- Really?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.21,0:53:08.13,italics,,0,0,0,,I was so scared
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.19,0:53:22.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.62,0:53:40.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, we meet again
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.38,0:53:46.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Take care of yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.34,0:53:47.67,general text,,0,0,0,,See you at the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.75,0:53:49.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.64,0:54:04.27,general text,,0,0,0,,What is it? Did you run here?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.19,0:54:06.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.19,0:54:08.86,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s been a long time since you visited me when I was wounded
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.94,0:54:09.78,general text,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.86,0:54:12.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Something more serious than a change of owner?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.24,0:54:13.20,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.28,0:54:15.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Other magicians were gossiping about you
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.32,0:54:16.49,general text,,0,0,0,,I wanted to know the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.57,0:54:18.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Got it. Have you heard about that tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.99,0:54:20.74,general text,,0,0,0,,But you know the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.83,0:54:24.12,general text,,0,0,0,,What if? You caught the Golden Fish while I was away
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.87,0:54:27.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe you really became Master Li’s student
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.13,0:54:29.25,general text,,0,0,0,,What? No, of course
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.34,0:54:30.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Forget
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.46,0:54:32.47,general text,,0,0,0,,I suggested it to you myself
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.26,0:54:34.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Probably couldn’t resist
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.97,0:54:36.84,general text,,0,0,0,,How can I prove it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.01,0:54:39.35,general text,,0,0,0,,You said it yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.15,0:54:50.15,general text,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.65,0:54:54.07,general text,,0,0,0,,You don’t see a woman in me
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.15,0:54:57.20,general text,,0,0,0,,I should have hugged that sweet girl as proof
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.57,0:55:00.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Should I really hug her?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.83,0:55:03.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. Come on
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.95,0:55:05.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t change your mind later
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.71,0:55:07.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.33,0:55:43.99,general text,,0,0,0,,You said we need to attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.08,0:55:46.46,general text,,0,0,0,,when the enemy least expects it
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.62,0:55:51.00,general text,,0,0,0,,I followed your advice, teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.80,0:55:56.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. Well done. I'm proud of you
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.84,0:56:00.01,general text,,0,0,0,,By the way, teacher,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.64,0:56:04.31,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard you ran into her in my room
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.48,0:56:07.56,general text,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.64,0:56:09.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Is that why you stopped me then?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.15,0:56:14.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Did this actually happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.53,0:56:17.03,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t remember
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.74,0:56:19.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Understanding you is more difficult than controlling you
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.91,0:56:21.28,general text,,0,0,0,,energy of Gyeongcheongdaeho
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.74,0:56:24.49,general text,,0,0,0,,You stopped me
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.00,0:56:29.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Teacher, I'm going to the palace today
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.58,0:56:31.46,general text,,0,0,0,,The King invited Master Li,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.08,0:56:34.17,general text,,0,0,0,,and I’ll keep him company
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.25,0:56:36.88,general text,,0,0,0,,I wanted to see the queen, and now I got the chance
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.63,0:56:39.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Be careful
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.47,0:56:43.30,general text,,0,0,0,,I will. I'll tell you everything when I get back
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.27,0:56:52.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.61,0:56:57.90,general text,,0,0,0,,I found it
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.65,0:57:03.66,general text,,0,0,0,,It happened, so I thought I should tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.91,0:57:06.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Go
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.26,0:57:28.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Why is the head of Sosnovy Bor looking for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.64,0:57:31.73,general text,,0,0,0,,- Remember Moo Dok?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.81,0:57:34.81,general text,,0,0,0,,He wants to know more about her life in Sari
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.90,0:57:38.15,general text,,0,0,0,,He can ask her himself
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.23,0:57:39.19,general text,,0,0,0,,She is here
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.28,0:57:41.74,general text,,0,0,0,,No. She is in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.82,0:57:42.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.74,0:57:46.58,general text,,0,0,0,,What is the blind woman doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.87,0:57:51.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Lee wants you two and Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.50,0:57:53.33,general text,,0,0,0,,escorted him to the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.50,0:57:55.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Will Uk also work?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.34,0:57:58.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Is he feeling better already?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.55,0:58:00.42,general text,,0,0,0,,We're leaving soon. Get ready
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.72,0:58:11.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Be careful in the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.48,0:58:13.85,general text,,0,0,0,,There is an ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.52,0:58:17.11,general text,,0,0,0,,I know it myself
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.19,0:58:20.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Since they shamelessly hide it,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.44,0:58:23.40,general text,,0,0,0,,I decided to brazenly make a move
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.99,0:58:31.58,general text,,0,0,0,,When was the last time I was invited to the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.16,0:58:34.58,general text,,0,0,0,,you were very small
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.12,0:58:38.13,general text,,0,0,0,,I remember how much I liked sweets,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.21,0:58:40.50,general text,,0,0,0,,which you then brought
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.59,0:58:41.76,general text,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.34,0:58:45.97,general text,,0,0,0,,won’t you give the king a gift?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.05,0:58:48.01,general text,,0,0,0,,I have already prepared one
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.10,0:58:48.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Yom
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.05,0:58:51.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Send a gift to the palace at the appointed time
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.97,0:58:53.52,italics,,0,0,0,,Yes, teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.60,0:58:55.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Somewhere between 5 and 7 pm?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.27,0:58:56.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Between 7 and 9, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.27,0:58:59.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly. Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.73,0:59:01.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Write it down if you can’t remember
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.65,0:59:04.15,general text,,0,0,0,,You were absent-minded before,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.24,0:59:07.16,general text,,0,0,0,,and with age everything got even worse
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.45,0:59:10.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Forward
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.08,0:59:12.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.95,0:59:16.62,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll never get used to this, guys
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.24,0:59:46.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.99,0:59:49.87,general text,,0,0,0,,The head wants to see you
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.33,0:59:52.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Chapter?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.42,1:00:02.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.64,1:00:20.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Everything about you has come to light
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.11,1:00:24.69,general text,,0,0,0,,I told him about your eyes
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.28,1:00:30.82,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Now everything will open?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.45,1:00:35.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Chapter, you see...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.70,1:00:39.12,general text,,0,0,0,,She wasn’t the only one lying
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.46,1:00:44.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Her grandmother begged me, so I played along
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.92,1:00:48.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Her family was very poor
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.38,1:00:50.30,general text,,0,0,0,,She lied that she was blind,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.88,1:00:53.35,general text,,0,0,0,,so that she is not sold to pay off debts
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.43,1:00:55.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Like those who pretend to be lame,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.72,1:00:57.68,general text,,0,0,0,,so as not to go to war
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.77,1:01:01.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you lie when you got to Chwisongra?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.11,1:01:06.61,italics,,0,0,0,,She wanted to escape
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.28,1:01:09.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course, it was sold
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.19,1:01:12.66,general text,,0,0,0,,But being blind it would be easier to escape
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.28,1:01:15.62,general text,,0,0,0,,- Am I right?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.70,1:01:18.66,general text,,0,0,0,,I tried to escape when I met the owner
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.37,1:01:22.04,general text,,0,0,0,,He took pity on me and took me in
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.92,1:01:27.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry for lying, chapter
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.30,1:01:29.55,general text,,0,0,0,,I did wrong
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.88,1:01:32.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Except for this lie,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.43,1:01:34.26,general text,,0,0,0,,she has no other sins
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.34,1:01:38.06,general text,,0,0,0,,She was always a good granddaughter and a kind girl
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.82,1:01:51.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you lie?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.07,1:01:56.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Just earning my money
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.62,1:01:57.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you earn the money?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.66,1:02:03.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Aren’t you blind?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.21,1:02:07.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, yes
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.17,1:02:10.63,general text,,0,0,0,,It always seemed strange to me
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.63,1:02:13.76,general text,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- Even being blind,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.84,1:02:16.09,general text,,0,0,0,,you always knew who was standing in front of you
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.18,1:02:18.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Knew if it would rain or snow
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.81,1:02:23.31,general text,,0,0,0,,The villagers thought you were lying about blindness
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.39,1:02:26.31,general text,,0,0,0,,They were afraid and avoided you
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.48,1:02:29.15,general text,,0,0,0,,- I see\N- In general,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.23,1:02:31.69,general text,,0,0,0,,if you need help, come to the inn
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.78,1:02:32.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.57,1:02:34.49,general text,,0,0,0,,By the way
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.03,1:02:37.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you met So Yi yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.41,1:02:39.58,general text,,0,0,0,,So I?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.66,1:02:41.66,general text,,0,0,0,,She is now in the capital
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.75,1:02:43.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Some bandits were looking for her
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.62,1:02:46.04,general text,,0,0,0,,What did she do this time?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.12,1:02:49.42,general text,,0,0,0,,She robbed your house after your grandmother died
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.25,1:02:52.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t mess with her
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.46,1:02:55.05,general text,,0,0,0,,It seems that you are hiding something from Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.43,1:02:59.64,general text,,0,0,0,,You said that you worked off the money. Who paid you?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.72,1:03:00.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Ju Wol
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.73,1:03:07.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t thank me
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.73,1:03:09.77,general text,,0,0,0,,It was Mr. Chan's money
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.24,1:03:19.12,memories,,0,0,0,,If anyone asks about Moo Deok,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.20,1:03:20.33,memories,,0,0,0,,use this money
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.49,1:03:24.08,memories,,0,0,0,,Of course, half is yours
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.75,1:03:27.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t hide anything vile
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.75,1:03:29.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Got my share
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.75,1:03:32.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, and I like you
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.55,1:03:35.22,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm really grateful
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.30,1:03:38.01,general text,,0,0,0,,What’s really wrong with your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.06,1:03:44.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Forget
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.27,1:03:45.98,general text,,0,0,0,,There are probably reasons
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.52,1:03:54.86,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,If Chang Wook had not prepared in advance, Park Jin would have found out everything
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.49,1:03:59.76,voiceover,,0,0,0,,If they catch me, Chan Wook will suffer too
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.34,1:04:15.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Welcome Master Lee Chul
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.17,1:04:18.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the invitation, Your Majesty
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.72,1:04:22.64,memories,,0,0,0,,This shaman Choi
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.22,1:04:25.18,memories,,0,0,0,,told you to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.44,1:04:30.65,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Shaman Choi
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.73,1:04:32.48,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Is this the queen?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.78,1:04:39.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.28,1:04:45.08,general text,,0,0,0,,So I, which you mentioned
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.70,1:04:48.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe this is the girl who was looking for you recently
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.58,1:04:51.71,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard she’s dangerous. Be careful
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.13,1:04:58.05,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,I don’t recognize her because I don’t know her
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.59,1:05:00.84,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Ask that guy about her?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.39,1:05:04.10,memories,,0,0,0,,If you need help, come to the inn
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.22,1:05:06.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Inn...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.36,1:05:17.15,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Everything about you came out
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.17,1:05:38.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Trader Kim from Sari Village is here?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.63,1:05:40.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, he is here
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.97,1:05:42.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Last room on the second floor
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.35,1:05:51.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Ajusshi, this is Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.38,1:06:19.38,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Ajusshi...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.27,1:06:33.73,italics,,0,0,0,,Master Li
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.81,1:06:36.61,general text,,0,0,0,,If you were a student of Master So Kyung,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.69,1:06:38.73,general text,,0,0,0,,now you are over a hundred years old
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.82,1:06:41.44,general text,,0,0,0,,How did you survive like this?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.03,1:06:45.16,general text,,0,0,0,,How many years would you give me?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.36,1:06:48.87,italics,,0,0,0,,A little over thirty
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.95,1:06:51.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Forty years at most
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.41,1:06:56.08,general text,,0,0,0,,You are right. This is my biological age
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.00,1:06:57.96,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.04,1:07:00.84,general text,,0,0,0,,My soul is a hundred years old
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.42,1:07:04.42,general text,,0,0,0,,The body with which I was born has long since turned to dust
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.51,1:07:07.18,general text,,0,0,0,,This body did not belong to me
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.39,1:07:10.26,italics,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.01,1:07:13.77,general text,,0,0,0,,So you are a nomad?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.85,1:07:14.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.89,1:07:18.27,general text,,0,0,0,,I am a nomad
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.95,1:07:28.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.32,1:07:32.45,general text,,0,0,0,,you called me to find another nomad?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.04,1:07:34.20,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll find him
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.87,1:07:38.17,general text,,0,0,0,,I can tell who is a nomad
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.51,1:07:53.56,voiceover,,0,0,0,,He knew from the very beginning that Moo Deok was a nomad
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.71,1:08:19.58,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s you
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.79,1:08:22.38,general text,,0,0,0,,killed him
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.92,1:09:06.55,preview,,0,0,0,,Why are there so many corpses here?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.63,1:09:09.05,preview,,0,0,0,,What kind of life did Moo Deok lead?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.13,1:09:11.93,preview,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok is hiding something
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.01,1:09:14.80,preview,,0,0,0,,- What cannot be revealed\N- Mommies!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.68,1:09:17.64,preview,,0,0,0,,He will start barking instead
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.39,1:09:22.10,preview,,0,0,0,,As I thought, there is more than one nomad in the palace
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.19,1:09:24.69,preview,,0,0,0,,If it turns out that the King’s star is a creation of dark magic,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.77,1:09:27.19,preview,,0,0,0,,Pine Forest will come to an end
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.73,1:09:28.57,preview,,0,0,0,,This is dangerous
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.65,1:09:31.24,preview,,0,0,0,,You don’t know her, but she knows Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.32,1:09:32.49,preview,,0,0,0,,We need Chang Gan
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.57,1:09:35.08,preview,,0,0,0,,We will wait for his return
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.37,1:09:37.95,preview,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.04,1:09:40.25,preview,,0,0,0,,I can’t leave my master
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.33,1:09:43.50,preview,,0,0,0,,Love me until you die
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.32,0:23:39.32,preview,,0,0,0,,

